// Set analysis for comparisons — Qlik Sense Business Analyst (QSBA)
// Goal: Build YoY, % of total, and 'ignore filter' measures.
// Concepts: Set analysis ($ vs 1), Modifiers (set/clear/exclude), Dollar-sign expansion, % of total, Selection states
// Qlik load script starter. Adapt connections/paths to your environment.

Policies:
LOAD
    PolicyID,
    Region,
    Product,
    WrittenPremium,
    IncurredLoss,
    Date(PolicyDate) as PolicyDate
FROM [lib://data/policies.qvd] (qvd);

